        "prompt": "=Create a social media illustration image.\n\nPlatform: {{ $json.platform }}\nVisual idea: {{ $json.visual_idea }}\nTopic: {{ $json.title }}\n\nStyle: clean, professional, modern, suitable for ecommerce brands.\nSimple composition, good lighting, high clarity.\nNo clutter.\n\nSTRICT RULES:\n- Do NOT put any text, letters, numbers, words, logos, watermarks, or captions on the image.\n- No typography, no posters with readable text, no UI screenshots with text.\n- Pure visual only: scene, objects, abstract shapes, or illustration.",
        "options": {
